{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat pilot-c01-c02/skills/child-thinking-coach/SKILL.md; sed -n '1,125p' scripts/sigma_session_store.py; sed -n '89,135p' scripts/sigma_plan_store.py; rg -n 'add_argument|def start|def gate|diagnos|MODES' pilot-c01-c02/scripts/coach.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat pilot-c01-c02/skills/child-thinking-coach/SKILL.md; sed -n '1,125p' scripts/sigma_session_store.py; sed -n '89,135p' scripts/sigma_plan_store.py; rg -n 'add_argument|def start|def gate|diagnos|MODES' pilot-c01-c02/scripts/coach.py\"","aggregated_output":"---\nname: child-thinking-coach\ndescription: 在家长陪同下执行经人工发布的 C01 事实与推测、C02 属性比较试点，记录反馈和暂停恢复；不用于其他课程。\n---\n\n# 儿童思维教练\n\n只使用本试点脚本与已发布题卡；人工审核与家长陪同是前提。未通过门禁则停止，不编题、批准、发布或补充资料。不要向孩子显示题卡全文、成人答案、解释、审核文件或内部工具输出。此 Skill 在仓库试点目录，尚未全局安装。\n\n从项目根目录运行 `python3 pilot-c01-c02/scripts/coach.py <命令> --learner <化名>`。入口：`start --mode diagnosis|C01|C02`、`show`、`progress`、`pause`、`resume`、`skip`、`complete`、`end`、`feedback --text ...`。恢复、进度、完成均以脚本当前持久化返回值为准，不据聊天上下文猜测；脚本错误或没有 `status: completed` 时，不能说训练已经结束。最后一题的回答正确且理由有效时 `attempt` 自动返回 completed；否则最后一题经 `skip`/`complete` 返回 completed 后才可告知结束；重复完成是幂等的。中途可暂停或结束。\n\n`show` 后只呈现一道题面。等待回答后用 `attempt --response <原话> --correctness correct|partial|incorrect|unknown --explanation valid|invalid|unclear|none` 单独保存原答与 AI 临时评价；任何一次回答均不能证明掌握。答案正确但理由错误时不复述、纠正或暗示原题具体事实与推理，不公布原题关键解释；只说“我们再看看你的理由，你愿意用另一种方式说明吗？”可选提示或休息。更一般地，错误选项不要逐项排除，避免利用排除法泄漏。\n\n“不知道”记录 unknown/none，接纳并提供提示、平行示范或休息。孩子明确要答案时，不公布当题答案；可选择继续思考、提示或休息。经过至少两次尝试或三级提示后，若孩子明确同意看完整讲解，调用 `explain --consent`，只在成功后展示其结果；该事件记录 full_explanation 教学支持，不能视为独立掌握。直接请求本身可作为同意，但不能绕过尝试门槛。\n\n提示用 `hint` 按 H1、H2、H3 递进；H1 只指观察方向，H2 是通用方法，不对当前选项排除或指出唯一结果；H3 展示脚本返回的已审核平行示范，不套回原题、不逐项映射。此前未尝试不提示。`demo` 可提供已审核平行例；全程不为原题编造或展开解析。连续两次错误后不强迫继续，提供跳过、示范或暂停。一轮只问一个主要问题及最多一个必要追问。约20分钟为参考，疲劳立即允许暂停。\n\n`complete` 或 `skip` 不表示掌握；记录成人反馈。只记必要原话摘要，不收集真实姓名、学校、位置、照片或声音。本地文件与模型上下文不是安全访问控制。\n\n继续和跳过是不同操作。每次收到“继续”或“下一题”时先执行 `progress`：若当前题已展示且尚未作答或跳过，保留当前题，向孩子说明正在处理该题，询问是否想回答、提示或明确跳过。不得仅凭“继续”“下一题”推断跳过，也不得自行调用 `skip`；只有当孩子明确要求跳过当前题时才调用 `skip`。若会话暂停，先 `resume`，再查询当前题。\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Atomic Sigma session snapshot; not a teaching gate.\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport fcntl\nimport json\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport sys\nimport tempfile\n\nimport learning_evidence as evidence\n\nclass Invalid(ValueError):\n    pass\n\nLEGACY = ('state.json', 'session.md', 'turns.jsonl')\n\ndef read_folder(folder):\n    \"\"\"Read with the learner lock already held, or from an atomically replaced file.\"\"\"\n    dest = folder / 'sigma'\n    if any((dest / name).exists() for name in LEGACY):\n        raise Invalid('发现旧版 Sigma 会话文件；停止并人工核对迁移，不能自动覆盖或忽略')\n    return read(dest / 'session-snapshot.json')\n\ndef read(path):\n    if not path.exists():\n        return {'schema_version': 1, 'revision': 0, 'state': {}, 'session': '', 'turns': []}\n    obj = json.loads(path.read_text(encoding='utf-8'))\n    validate(obj)\n    return obj\n\ndef validate(obj):\n    if (not isinstance(obj, dict) or set(obj) != {'schema_version', 'revision', 'state', 'session', 'turns'}\n        or type(obj['schema_version']) is not int or obj['schema_version'] != 1\n        or type(obj['revision']) is not int or obj['revision'] < 0\n        or not isinstance(obj['state'], dict) or not isinstance(obj['session'], str)\n        or not isinstance(obj['turns'], list) or any(not isinstance(t, dict) for t in obj['turns'])):\n        raise Invalid('会话快照格式无效')\n    if 'planning_basis' in obj['state'] and not isinstance(obj['state']['planning_basis'], dict):\n        raise Invalid('planning_basis 必须是对象')\n\ndef validate_new_events(previous, current):\n    \"\"\"Validate new analysis records without rewriting legacy snapshot history.\"\"\"\n    turns = current['turns']\n    added = turns[len(previous['turns']):]\n    for event in added:\n        if event.get('type') not in ('answer', 'analysis'):\n            continue\n        qid = event.get('question_id')\n        if not isinstance(qid, str) or not qid:\n            raise Invalid('回答和分析须关联问题 ID')\n        questions = [e for e in turns if e.get('type') == 'question' and e.get('question_id') == qid]\n        answers = [e for e in turns if e.get('type') == 'answer' and e.get('question_id') == qid]\n        analyses = [e for e in turns if e.get('type') == 'analysis' and e.get('question_id') == qid]\n        if len(questions) != 1 or len(answers) != 1 or len(analyses) != 1:\n            raise Invalid('每个新回答须关联唯一问题和唯一分析，并在同次提交中保存')\n        analysis = analyses[0].get('analysis')\n        if not isinstance(analysis, dict) or not analysis:\n            raise Invalid('分析须为非空对象')\n        if turns.index(questions[0]) >= turns.index(answers[0]) or turns.index(answers[0]) >= turns.index(analyses[0]):\n            raise Invalid('事件顺序须为问题、回答、分析')\n\ndef operate(learner, proposed=None, expected=None):\n    folder = evidence.get_folder(learner)\n    dest = folder / 'sigma'\n    dest.mkdir(mode=0o700, exist_ok=True)\n    path = dest / 'session-snapshot.json'\n    with (folder / '.lock').open('a') as lock:\n        fcntl.flock(lock, fcntl.LOCK_EX)\n        previous = read_folder(folder)\n        if proposed is None:\n            return previous\n        if type(expected) is not int or expected != previous['revision']:\n            raise Invalid('会话已被更新，请重新读取后重试')\n        if not isinstance(proposed, dict) or set(proposed) != {'state', 'session', 'turns'}:\n            raise Invalid('提交须同时包含 state、session、turns')\n        current = {'schema_version': 1, 'revision': expected + 1, **proposed}\n        validate(current)\n        # Previously committed turns must remain byte-for-byte equivalent in JSON data.\n        if current['turns'][:len(previous['turns'])] != previous['turns']:\n            raise Invalid('不能覆盖已提交的逐轮记录')\n        validate_new_events(previous, current)\n        fd, temp = tempfile.mkstemp(dir=dest, prefix='.session-')\n        try:\n            os.fchmod(fd, 0o600)\n            with os.fdopen(fd, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                json.dump(current, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n                f.write('\\n'); f.flush(); os.fsync(f.fileno())\n            os.replace(temp, path)\n            directory = os.open(dest, os.O_RDONLY)\n            try: os.fsync(directory)\n            finally: os.close(directory)\n        finally:\n            if os.path.exists(temp): os.unlink(temp)\n        return current\n\ndef main():\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__)\n    parser.add_argument('action', choices=('read', 'commit'))\n    parser.add_argument('--learner', required=True)\n    parser.add_argument('--expected-revision', type=int)\n    args = parser.parse_args()\n    try:\n        result = operate(args.learner, json.load(sys.stdin), args.expected_revision) if args.action == 'commit' else operate(args.learner)\n        print(json.dumps(result, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n    except (Invalid, evidence.EvidenceError, evidence.coach.Stop, OSError, ValueError, TypeError) as exc:\n        print('停止：' + str(exc), file=sys.stderr)\n        return 1\n    return 0\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    sys.exit(main())\ndef operate(action, learner, candidate=None, session=None, payload=None):\n    folder=evidence.get_folder(learner); dest=folder/'sigma';dest.mkdir(mode=0o700,exist_ok=True)\n    path=dest/'plan-history.json'\n    # Lock order is publication, learner, plan, shared with coach/evidence.\n    with (evidence.coach.ROOT/'.publication.lock').open('a') as pub, (folder/'.lock').open('a') as learner_lock, (dest/'.plan-lock').open('a') as lock:\n        fcntl.flock(pub,fcntl.LOCK_SH); fcntl.flock(learner_lock,fcntl.LOCK_EX); fcntl.flock(lock,fcntl.LOCK_EX)\n        store=read(path)\n        if store.get('schema_version') != 1 or not isinstance(store.get('history'),list): raise Invalid('规划历史损坏')\n        ctx=planner.context(learner, already_locked=True)\n        if action == 'publish':\n            plan=json.loads(Path(candidate).read_text(encoding='utf-8'))\n            planner.validate(plan,ctx,learner)\n            records=[r for r in evidence.load_evidence(folder) if evidence.current_card(r['concept'], r['card'])]\n            # Recheck Wiki and snapshots while holding the shared authorization locks.\n            if planner.context(learner, already_locked=True) != ctx: raise Invalid('规划输入发生变化，请重试')\n            item={'version':len(store['history'])+1,'plan_sha256':sha(plan),'created_at':dt.datetime.now(dt.timezone.utc).isoformat(),\n                  'inputs':{k:ctx[k] for k in ('curriculum_digest','learner_digest','evidence_digest')},'plan':plan,'review_queue':queue(records,store['history'],store.get('review_events',[]))}\n            store['history'].append(item);write(path,store)\n        if not store['history']:\n            if action in ('schedule-dynamic', 'complete-dynamic'): raise Invalid('请先建立路线，再安排动态复习')\n            return {'status':'missing','review_queue':[], 'dynamic_reviews':[]}\n        item=store['history'][-1]\n        if item['plan_sha256'] != sha(item['plan']): raise Invalid('规划内容摘要不匹配')\n        if action in ('schedule-dynamic', 'complete-dynamic'):\n            if not isinstance(payload, dict): raise Invalid('动态复习需要 JSON 对象')\n            tasks = store.setdefault('dynamic_reviews', [])\n            snapshot = sessions.read_folder(folder)\n            now = dt.datetime.now(dt.timezone.utc)\n            if action == 'schedule-dynamic':\n                if set(payload) != {'concept', 'question_id', 'reason', 'interval_days'}:\n                    raise Invalid('安排复习字段无效')\n                concept, qid, reason, days = (payload[k] for k in ('concept','question_id','reason','interval_days'))\n                if not isinstance(concept, str) or concept not in {c['id'] for c in ctx['curriculum']['concepts']}:\n                    raise Invalid('未知概念')\n                if not isinstance(qid, str) or not qid or not isinstance(reason, str) or not reason.strip():\n                    raise Invalid('须提供问题 ID 和复习依据')\n                if type(days) is not int or not 1 <= days <= 32: raise Invalid('复习间隔须为 1 至 32 天')\n                dynamic_answer(snapshot, qid)\n                if any(t['concept'] == concept and t['status'] == 'pending' for t in tasks):\n                    raise Invalid('该概念已有待完成的动态复习')\n                tasks.append({'task_id':str(uuid.uuid4()), 'concept':concept, 'source_question_id':qid,\n                              'reason':reason, 'interval_days':days, 'scheduled_at':now.isoformat(),\n                              'due_at':(now + dt.timedelta(days=days)).isoformat(), 'status':'pending'})\n            else:\n                if set(payload) != {'task_id', 'question_id', 'result', 'next_interval_days'}:\n                    raise Invalid('完成复习字段无效')\n                task_id_value, qid, result, days = (payload[k] for k in ('task_id','question_id','result','next_interval_days'))\n17:MODES = {'diagnosis': ['PILOT-DIAG-C01', 'PILOT-DIAG-C02'], 'C01': ['ST-C01-01'], 'C02': ['ST-C02-01']}\n48:def gate(concept):\n190:    evidence.coach = types.SimpleNamespace(MODES=MODES, gate=gate, load_card=load_card)\n224:            for qid in MODES[args.mode]:\n316:    p=sub.add_parser('hash'); p.add_argument('question')\n318:        p=sub.add_parser(action); p.add_argument('--learner',required=True,help='不含真实姓名的化名')\n319:        if action=='start': p.add_argument('--mode',required=True,choices=list(MODES))\n321:            p.add_argument('--response',required=True); p.add_argument('--correctness',required=True,choices=['correct','partial','incorrect','unknown']); p.add_argument('--explanation',required=True,choices=['valid','invalid','unclear','none'])\n322:        if action=='explain': p.add_argument('--consent',action='store_true')\n323:        if action in ('pause','end'): p.add_argument('--text',default='')\n324:        if action=='feedback': p.add_argument('--text',required=True)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
